# Normalise text files to LF in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# The regression tests compare the program's output byte for byte against the
# fixtures in `tests/data`, and the port always writes `\n` (Rust does not
# translate newlines, unlike C's text mode streams).  With the Git for Windows
# default `core.autocrlf=true` these fixtures would be checked out with CRLF,
# making the comparisons fail on the `windows-latest` CI runner.
* text=auto

tests/data/** text eol=lf
